# MaisCapinhas ERP API - HTTP Requests
# Use com a extensão REST Client do VS Code ou similar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### ==============================================
### HEALTH & VERSION (Public)
### ==============================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Version Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/version

### ==============================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ==============================================

### Login (Admin)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@maiscapinhas.com.br",
    "password": "password"
}

### Login (Vendedor)
# @name loginVendedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "joao.vendedor@maiscapinhas.com.br",
    "password": "password"
}

### Login (Conferente)
# @name loginConferente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana.conferente@maiscapinhas.com.br",
    "password": "password"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout All Sessions
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### ME (Current User)
### ==============================================

### Get Current User with Stores and Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### STORES
### ==============================================

### List My Stores
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Store Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### SALES
### ==============================================

### List Sales (all my stores)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Sales with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?store_id=1&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-01-31&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Sales by Seller
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?store_id=1&seller_id=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### CASH SHIFTS
### ==============================================

### List Shifts
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash/shifts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Shifts with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash/shifts?store_id=1&status=open
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Shifts by Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash/shifts?store_id=1&date=2026-01-07
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create New Shift
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash/shifts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "store_id": 1,
    "date": "2026-01-07",
    "shift_code": "T"
}

### Get Shift Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash/shifts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### CASH CLOSINGS
### ==============================================

### Get Closing Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/cash/closings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit Closing for Review
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash/closings/1/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve Closing (requires conferente/gerente/admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash/closings/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reject Closing (requires reason)
POST {{baseUrl}}/cash/closings/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "reason": "Valores do dinheiro não conferem com o relatório do PDV. Por favor, revisar."
}

### ==============================================
### DASHBOARDS
### ==============================================

### Dashboard Vendedor (Seller)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/vendedor?store_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard Vendedor with Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/vendedor?store_id=1&date=2026-01-06
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard Conferente (Reviewer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/conferente?store_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard Conferente with Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/conferente?store_id=1&date=2026-01-06
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard Admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard Admin with Month
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/admin?month=2026-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ==============================================
### EXAMPLE WORKFLOWS
### ==============================================

### Workflow 1: Complete Shift Closing
### 1. Login as vendedor
### 2. Create shift (done via seed)
### 3. Submit closing
### 4. Login as conferente
### 5. Approve or reject

### Workflow 2: Check Pending Closings
### 1. Login as conferente
### 2. GET /dashboard/conferente?store_id=1
### 3. Review pending_closings array
### 4. POST /cash/closings/{shift_id}/approve or /reject
